(F4 T6b, K24 deliberate divergence class A, owner decision 2026-10-11.
 3D Biot u-p consolidation column: brick macro of 10x2x2 nodes over
 [0,1]x[-0.5,0.5]^2, E=10 -total_linear, capacity 1, force_edge 1.0 on the
 x=0 face, velocity and pres fixed on x=1 with pres ramped -1 -> 0 over
 the first step, control_reset pres -1, inertia_apply -yes.
 The u-p system is NOT symmetric. With solver_matrix_symmetric -yes the
 Professional 02-08-2026 symmetrizes it (manual 6.1052) and its pres
 drifts with no flow (undrained) and has the wrong sign for small
 capacities; the GNU keeps the as-assembled matrix (Bi-CG, warning), so
 -yes and -no give the same answer. Targets at node 1 (0,-0.5,-0.5) =
 Professional 02-08-2026 run with solver_matrix_symmetric -no.
 Same as k24_consol_3d1 with solver_matrix_symmetric -no: same targets
 (the GNU result does not depend on the switch).)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 3
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
groundflow_pressure
groundflow_velocity
end_initia
inertia_apply -yes
groundflow_consolidation_apply -yes
solver_matrix_symmetric -no
start_define
  delta_time 0.1
end_define
group_type 0  -materi -groundflow
group_materi_elasti_young  0  1.0e1
group_materi_memory 0  -total_linear
group_groundflow_permeability 0 0.1
group_groundflow_capacity 0 1.0
geometry_quadrilateral 10  0.0 -10.0 -10.0  0.0 +10.0 -10.0  0.0 -10.0 +10.0  0.0 +10.0 +10.0  1.e-4
geometry_quadrilateral 20  1.0 -10.0 -10.0  1.0 +10.0 -10.0  1.0 -10.0 +10.0  1.0 +10.0 +10.0  1.e-4
bounda_dof     1  -geometry_quadrilateral 20 -velx -vely -velz
bounda_time    1  0.
bounda_dof     2  -geometry_quadrilateral 20 -pres
bounda_time    2  0. -1. delta_time 0. 1000. 0.
post_calcul -groundflow_pressure -total_pressure
force_edge 10  1.0 0.0 0.0
force_edge_geometry 10  -geometry_quadrilateral 10
control_mesh_macro            10  -brick 0 10 2 2
control_mesh_macro_parameters 10  0.5 0.0 0.0 1.0 1.0 1.0
control_reset_dof             20  -pres
control_reset_value_constant  20  -1.0
control_timestep              30  delta_time 2.2
target_item  0  -node_dof 1 -pres
target_value  0  -0.7085296 7.e-4
target_item  1  -node_dof 1 -disx
target_value  1  0.05420111 5.4e-5
end_data
